 they are fuller. I am over 60, so who knows if anything works. I am upgrading to the serum + for my lashes and brows. Will review after using one month.","dateCreated":"2021-04-02T00:00:00.000Z","dateUpdated":"2021-04-02T00:00:00.000Z","helpfulCount":0,"isRecommended":true,"languageCode":"en","productHandle":"gro-lash-serum","productImageUrl":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1336/0857/files/vegamour-01-gro-lash-serum-pdp-hero-v1_x280.jpg?v=1787691531","productName":"GRO Lash Serum","productUrl":"//vegamour.com/products/gro-lash-serum","rating":5,"reviewer":{"displayName":"Carol N.","isVerified":true},"isIncentivized":false,"status":"approved","title":"I had given up hope","unhelpfulCount":0},{"subscriberId":"9e65baea-5deb-4e8a-ac91-a1200eb60a01","reviewId":"b0cba4bf-176a-464e-a39c-0c89e7ce622c","subscriberId_productId":"9e65baea-5deb-4e8a-ac91-a1200eb60a01:shopify-6555775169","productId":"shopify-6555775169","body":"It's been maybe 5 weeks and I honestly don't see any chance on my eyelashes. \r\nMaybe I will see something in another month? Crossing fingers!","dateCreated":"2021-04-02T00:00:00.000Z","dateUpdated":"2021-04-02T00:00:00.000Z","helpfulCount":0,"languageCode":"en","productHandle":"gro-lash-serum","productImageUrl":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1336/0857/files/vegamour-01-gro-lash-serum-pdp-hero-v1_x280.jpg?v=1787691531","productName":"GRO Lash Serum","productUrl":"//vegamour.com/products/gro-lash-serum","rating":3,"reviewer":{"displayName":"Sara A.","isVerified":true},"isIncentivized":false,"status":"approved","title":"Nothing yet for me","unhelpfulCount":0},{"subscriberId":"9e65baea-5deb-4e8a-ac91-a1200eb60a01","reviewId":"af467cc9-0fb7-4ad6-a0cd-889887340b7b","subscriberId_productId":"9e65baea-5deb-4e8a-ac91-a1200eb60a01:shopify-6555775169","productId":"shopify-6555775169","body":"Very happy with the lash serum. Easy to apply. Very mild lash serum.","dateCreated":"2021-03-27T00:00:00.000Z","dateUpdated":"2021-03-27T00:00:00.000Z","helpfulCount":0,"isRecommended":true,"languageCode":"en","productHandle":"gro-lash-serum","productImageUrl":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1336/0857/files/vegamour-01-gro-lash-serum-pdp-hero-v1_x280.jpg?v=1787691531","productName":"GRO Lash Serum","productUrl":"//vegamour.com/products/gro-lash-serum","rating":5,"reviewer":{"displayName":"Monika S.","isVerified":true},"isIncentivized":false,"status":"approved","title":"Very happy with the lash","unhelpfulCount":0},{"subscriberId":"9e65baea-5deb-4e8a-ac91-a1200eb60a01","reviewId":"3304aa4a-14de-4af3-b8d7-a83da0d4d63e","subscriberId_productId":"9e65baea-5deb-4e8a-ac91-a1200eb60a01:shopify-6555775169","productId":"shopify-6555775169","body":"I’m officially four weeks into my serum use and I’m pleasantly surprised with my results! My results aren’t as drastic as some pictured, but I’m still pleased. I use the regular lash serum as instructed on my top lashes I my twice a day (there was one day where I only applied once). I’m lucky to have a dark, thick lash line, but my lashes have always been really short. It was almost impossible to curl them, and when I did it would actually hurt a little (from the curler pulling the lashes). \r\n\r\nI don’t know if my results are noticeable to anyone else yet, but I can see a difference. My lashes are thicker, darker, and a little bit longer. It’s hard to judge exactly how much longer they’ve gotten (when I close my eyes, my bottom lashes would stick out longer than my top lashes), but there’s definitely a difference! The difference is most obvious when I curl them, they actually stay visibly curled and there’s no pinching pain!!!\r\n\r\nAll pictures are of my naked lashes (no mascara or serum). Before pics on top, after pictures on bottom. \r\n\r\nI’ll update my review after 8 weeks.","dateCreated":"2021-03-25T00:00:00.000Z","dateUpdated":"2021-03-25T00:00:00.000Z","helpfulCount":1,"isRecommended":true,"languageCode":"en","productHandle":"gro-lash-serum","productImageUrl":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1336/0857/files/vegamour-01-gro-lash-serum-pdp-hero-v1_x280.jpg?v=1787691531","productName":"GRO Lash Serum","productUrl":"//vegamour.com/products/gro-lash-serum","rating":4,"reviewer":{"displayName":"Jessica","isVerified":true},"isIncentivized":false,"status":"approved","title":"Four Weeks In","unhelpfulCount":0},{"subscriberId":"9e65baea-5deb-4e8a-ac91-a1200eb60a01","reviewId":"92a0dcdc-7668-4564-9d01-fa62f1a72f3a","subscriberId_productId":"9e65baea-5deb-4e8a-ac91-a1200eb60a01:shopify-6555775169","productId":"shopify-6555775169","body":"Not much of a difference for me personally but I do love the hair serum and can see a difference with that product.","dateCreated":"2021-03-25T00:00:00.000Z","dateUpdated":"2021-03-25T00:00:00.000Z","helpfulCount":0,"isRecommended":false,"languageCode":"en","productHandle":"gro-lash-serum","productImageUrl":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1336/0857/files/vegamour-01-gro-lash-serum-pdp-hero-v1_x280.jpg?v=1787691531","productName":"GRO Lash Serum","productUrl":"//vegamour.com/products/gro-lash-serum","rating":2,"reviewer":{"displayName":"Sherri G.","isVerified":true},"isIncentivized":false,"status":"approved","title":"Not much of a difference","unhelpfulCount":0},{"subscriberId":"9e65baea-5deb-4e8a-ac91-a1200eb60a01","reviewId":"1779b7fc-453a-4563-8598-953736ea92f4","subscriberId_productId":"9e65baea-5deb-4e8a-ac91-a1200eb60a01:shopify-6555775169","productId":"shopify-6555775169","body":"I am that regular applying person, but still I can see the difference.\r\nThank you","dateCreated":"2021-03-24T00:00:00.000Z","dateUpdated":"2021-03-24T00:00:00.000Z","helpfulCount":0,"isRecommended":true,"languageCode":"en","productHandle":"gro-lash-serum","productImageUrl":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1336/0857/files/vegamour-01-gro-lash-serum-pdp-hero-v1_x280.jpg?v=1787691531","productName":"GRO Lash Serum","productUrl":"//vegamour.com/products/gro-lash-serum","rating":5,"reviewer":{"displayName":"Asma M.","isVerified":true